     "body_en": "ICBCCS Financial Services released \"To Investors: In the midst of fluctuations, waiting for stability\" on November 3, saying that the current position of domestic equity has medium-term allocation value. ICBCCS said: From the perspective of valuation and chips, the valuation pressure and congestion in the growth direction have been significantly alleviated from the end of the third quarter, and there is relatively limited room for continued sharp decline. From the perspective of capital supply and demand, share buyback cancellation normalization, active ETF position building and swap convenience restart, together constitute a low undertaking force, and the policy is clear \"moderate release of financing space\", which also means that the liquidity environment will not be further tightened.",
