     "body_en": "Institutional insiders believe that external liquidity is tight and short-term risk appetite is still suppressed, which makes it inevitable for the market to repeat itself, but A-shares are in the gestation period of rebound, not the end of the market. The profitability of the third quarter report continued to recover, and the industrial capital increased its holdings with real gold and silver share buyback, confirming the bottom area and constituting medium-term support; with external uncertainty clearing, risk appetite is expected to recover. In terms of operation, the institution recommends that bonus assets be bottoming out, performance growth relay, short-term grasp of the repair window, anchor performance certainty in the medium term, and be laid out in the risk appetite repair. (China Securities Report).",
